<title>USA: Insignia Financial to buy Chicago firm.</title>
<headline>Insignia Financial to buy Chicago firm.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insignia Financial Group Inc said it signed a definitive agreement to buy Frain Camins &amp; Swartchild Inc, a Chicago-based commercial, retail and industrial real estate brokerage and management company.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Frain Camins had 1996 revenues of more than $14 million, Insignia said.</p>
<p>The acquisition is another step in Insignia's efforts to build its business nationally, Insignia said.</p>
